{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03358","headline":"桂州黄潭舜祠 · 宋之问","name":"桂州黄潭舜祠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虞世巡百越，相传葬九疑。\n精灵游此地，祠树日光辉。\n禋祭忽羣望，丹青图二妃。\n神来兽率舞，仙去凤还飞。\n日暝山气落，江空潭霭微。\n帝乡三万里，乘彼白云归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03358.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03358","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}